#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:5
msgid "Cross references properties"
msgstr "交叉引用属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:7
msgid ""
"The main advantage of using `Master`_ and `Slave`_ elements is the "
"possibility to create `cross references (links)`_ between `elements`_. At "
"the case of `cross references definition`_, QElectroTech allows you to "
"display automatically at the `workspace`_  information from the `Master`_ or"
" `Slave`_ linked element."
msgstr ""
"使用 `主元件 <Master_>`_ 和 `从元件 <Slave_>`_ 的主要优点在于，可以在 `元件 <elements_>`_ 之间创建 "
"`交叉引用（链接） <cross references (links)_>`_ 。在 `交叉引用定义 <cross references "
"definition_>`_ 的情况下，QElectroTech 允许在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中自动显示来自所链接的 `主元件 "
"<Master_>`_ 或 `从元件 <Slave_>`_ 的信息。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:12
msgid ""
"The definition or cross references properties inside a project can be "
"customized by the user at `project properties`_."
msgstr "项目中的交叉引用定义或属性可由用户在 `项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 中自定义。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:17
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining automatically `cross references properties`_ "
"during `project creation`_. For more  information about how to standardize "
"some `cross references properties`_ from `project`_ to `project`_, please "
"refers to the `QElectroTech cross references settings`_ section."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ 期间自动定义 `交叉引用属性 <cross "
"references properties_>`_ 。有关如何让某些 `交叉引用属性 <cross references properties_>`_ "
"从一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 到另一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 保持统一的更多信息，请参阅 `QElectroTech "
"交叉引用设置 <QElectroTech cross references settings_>`_ 一节。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:21
msgid ""
"The **Cross references** tab from **New folio** settings section allows pre-"
"defining some `cross references properties`_:"
msgstr ""
"**新建图幅** 设置部分中的 **交叉引用** 标签页允许预先定义一些 `交叉引用属性 <cross references "
"properties_>`_ ："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:24
msgid ""
"Cross references `Master element`_ type (Coil, organ of protection or "
"Switch/button)."
msgstr "交叉引用 `主元件 <Master element_>`_ 类型（线圈、保护元件或开关/按钮）。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:25
msgid ""
"Cross references label (Master and slave cross references label to be "
"display at the `workspace`_)"
msgstr "交叉引用标签（要在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中显示的主元件和从元件交叉引用标签）"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:26
msgid ""
"Representation position from the cross references label (Under the element "
"label or Footer)."
msgstr "交叉引用标签的显示位置（元件标签下方或页脚）。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:27
msgid "Display option from `cross references`_"
msgstr "`交叉引用 <cross references_>`_ 的显示选项"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:31
msgid ""
"The cross reference label can be created using the general variables from "
"`Master`_ and `Slave`_ elements."
msgstr "交叉引用标签可以使用 `主元件 <Master_>`_ 和 `从元件 <Slave_>`_ 的通用变量来创建。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:36
msgid "Figure: Project cross referencing properties window"
msgstr "图：项目交叉引用属性窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:38
msgid "To define cross references settings:"
msgstr "要定义交叉引用设置："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:40
msgid "`Display`_ project properties PopUP window."
msgstr "`显示 <Display_>`_ 项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:41
msgid "Go to **New folio** section."
msgstr "转到 **新建图幅** 部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:42
msgid "Go to **Cross references** tab."
msgstr "转到 **交叉引用** 标签页。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:43
msgid "Define the desired parameters for each field."
msgstr "为每个字段设置所需的参数。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:44
msgid ""
"Press **OK** button to save the configuration changes and close project "
"properties PopUP window."
msgstr "按 **OK** 按钮保存配置更改并关闭项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/new_folio/cross_references.rst:48
msgid ""
"All pre-defined cross references properties defined at QElectroTech settings"
" PopUP window will be automatically defined during `project creation`_ at "
"`project properties`_. The cross references properties can be found at "
"`Cross references tab`_ tab from `New folio`_ section."
msgstr ""
"在 QElectroTech 设置弹出窗口中预定义的所有交叉引用属性，都会在 `项目创建 <project creation_>`_ 时自动填入 "
"`项目属性 <project properties_>`_ 。交叉引用属性可在 `新建图幅 <New folio_>`_ 部分的 `交叉引用标签页 "
"<Cross references tab_>`_ 中找到。"
